From 504c47964f0ca3a7cf67b0bd318f6f13032ef4e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 05:29:35 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] prl: advantage / return / value distributions and the
 critic's explained variance

Miles logs only the means of the token-level rollout fields. After them, log the std / min / max of
advantages, returns and values over the loss-masked tokens, and 1 - Var(returns - values) / Var(returns)
(verl's critic/vf_explained_var) when values are present, reduced over the DP x CP ranks from
(sum, sum of squares, count, min, max) on CP-local masks. Logged as "rollout_dist N" at the rollout step.
A failure on a rank logs a warning and still joins the gather, so it never stalls or stops training.
---
 .../training_utils/metrics/log_utils.py       | 65 ++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 64 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/miles/backends/training_utils/metrics/log_utils.py b/miles/backends/training_utils/metrics/log_utils.py
